2026-10-30T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Recording a live run: house recorder at 4K, CineForm, no FFmpeg tool
 # uuid: 7efce4ce-c51c-589f-90bf-620e51881785
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-30T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2349) 'one way to record a run where a live model plays
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2349) 'every recording of a live run in the workspace, first the decider games
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2349) 'A live run is recorded at 4K, in CineForm, with the house recorder.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Movie Maker renders at a fixed frame rate, so the game waits for the model and the video
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2349) 'hides its latency. A video of a live model must show the latency it has.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Read RFD66606-2345 for the format this RFD amends.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2349) 'The recorder, the codec, the check and what is open
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2349) 'A live run is recorded with the house recorder on the Mac at a
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2349) '3840x2160 canvas. The recorder writes CineForm video and FLAC audio in
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Matroska through its custom output. The game runs on the wall clock
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2349) 'and never waits for the model. Godot Movie Maker is blocklisted.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2349) 'FFmpeg never runs as a tool. RFD66606-2345's format stands; this RFD
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2349) 'replaces its encoder, its live recorder and its file check.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

