 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2349) '  tick. With no reply the game takes its default move.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

